{"config": "B-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A01", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The minimum cooling‑off period that an NBFC must provide a borrower is one day.", "citations": ["D16_B_0019"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000166575, "gen_latency_s": 0.7387425000051735, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2229, "output_tokens": 94, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000166575, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0019", "D16_B_0037", "D16_B_0021", "D16_B_0014", "D16_B_0017"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.10501149999618065, "total_latency_s": 0.8438716999953613, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A02", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": true, "answer": "If a lender processes digital lending data outside India, the data must be deleted from any servers outside India and returned to Indian servers within 24 hours of processing. This requirement applies to NBFCs and their LSPs under the RBI Directions, and it is conditioned on meeting any further requirements set by the Central Government under the Digital Personal Data Protection Rules.", "citations": ["D16_B_0022", "D15_B_0018"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000232875, "gen_latency_s": 1.1238453999976628, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2617, "output_tokens": 218, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000232875, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D15_B_0018", "D16_B_0022", "D16_B_0021", "D16_B_0026", "D16_B_0013"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.08695700000680517, "total_latency_s": 1.2109234999952605, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.5, "first_hit_rank": 2, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A03", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The cap on Default Loss Guarantee (DLG) cover for an NBFC is five percent (5%) of the total amount disbursed from the loan portfolio at any given time.", "citations": ["D16_B_0033"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00020654999999999998, "gen_latency_s": 1.0347348999930546, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2690, "output_tokens": 112, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00020655, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0033", "D16_B_0005", "D16_B_0034", "D16_B_0028", "D16_B_0039"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.08738979999907315, "total_latency_s": 1.1222350999887567, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A04", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "An NBFC must report its digital lending apps on the Centralised Information Management System (CIMS) portal of the Reserve Bank of India.", "citations": ["D16_B_0026"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.0002121, "gen_latency_s": 1.1309348000067985, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2840, "output_tokens": 93, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.0002121, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0026", "D16_B_0015", "D16_B_0027", "D16_B_0020", "D16_B_0011"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.0437277000019094, "total_latency_s": 1.1747572000022046, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A05", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "When a lending service provider (LSP) works with multiple lenders, it must show the borrower a digital view of all loan offers that match the borrower’s request, including the name(s) of the lenders extending the offer, the amount and tenor of the loan, the APR, the monthly repayment obligation, any penal charges (if applicable), and a link to the Key Financial Statement for each lender. The digital view must also disclose the names of lenders whose offers do not match the borrower’s request and must be presented in an unbiased, objective manner.", "citations": ["D16_B_0013"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00022597499999999998, "gen_latency_s": 1.095812500003376, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2473, "output_tokens": 231, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000225975, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0013", "D16_B_0016", "D16_B_0049", "D16_B_0029", "D16_B_0021"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.04146019999461714, "total_latency_s": 1.1373772000079043, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A06", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "Yes. An NBFC may retain a reasonable one‑time processing fee if a borrower exits a digital loan during the cooling‑off period, provided that this fee is disclosed to the customer upfront in the Know‑Your‑Customer‑Statement (KFS).", "citations": ["D16_B_0019"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000219, "gen_latency_s": 1.0970860999950673, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2580, "output_tokens": 181, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000219, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0019", "D16_B_0018", "D16_B_0017", "D16_B_0021", "D16_B_0013"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.046355800004675984, "total_latency_s": 1.1435403000068618, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A07", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "No – a lending app (NBFC) is prohibited from accessing a borrower’s contact list or photo/media files on the phone. The directions state that an NBFC must refrain from accessing mobile phone resources such as file and media, contact list, call logs, and telephony functions. Only a one‑time access to camera, microphone, or location is allowed for onboarding/KYC, with explicit consent.", "citations": ["D16_B_0021"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000233775, "gen_latency_s": 1.0236950000107754, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2297, "output_tokens": 205, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000233775, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0021", "D16_B_0014", "D16_B_0016", "D16_B_0013", "D16_B_0022"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03794129999005236, "total_latency_s": 1.0617460000066785, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A08", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "If an NBFC or its LSP has not replied to a digital lending complaint within 30 days of receipt, the borrower may lodge a complaint with the Reserve Bank’s Complaint Management System (CMS – https://cms.rbi.org.in/) or send a physical complaint to the Centralised Receipt and Processing Centre at the Reserve Bank of India in Chandigarh, as prescribed under the Reserve Bank‑Integrated Ombudsman Scheme.", "citations": ["D16_B_0020"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00023977500000000001, "gen_latency_s": 1.4847233000036795, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2445, "output_tokens": 188, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000239775, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_B_0020", "D16_B_0013", "D16_B_0016", "D16_B_0015", "D16_B_0014"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.04094390000682324, "total_latency_s": 1.5257680000067921, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A09", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "A new payment aggregator must have a minimum net‑worth of ₹15 crore when tendering its application for authorisation, and must attain a minimum net‑worth of ₹25 crore by the end of the third financial year of grant of authorisation.", "citations": ["D06_B_0008"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00023505, "gen_latency_s": 0.8747302999981912, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2922, "output_tokens": 149, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00023505, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D06_B_0008", "D13_B_0009", "D06_B_0007", "D11_B_0009", "D11_B_0012"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03667300000961404, "total_latency_s": 0.9115029999957187, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A10", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "An entity that carried out only PA‑P (physical‑payment‑aggregator) business was required to apply for RBI authorisation by 31 December 2025. If it failed to submit the application by that date, it must inform its banker(s) immediately and wind up its PA‑P business by 28 February 2026.", "citations": ["D06_B_0007"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00025807499999999997, "gen_latency_s": 1.2210606000007829, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3069, "output_tokens": 189, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000258075, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D06_B_0007", "D06_B_0005", "D11_B_0011", "D06_B_0020", "D06_B_0008"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.05336999999417458, "total_latency_s": 1.2745399000123143, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A11", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "A non‑bank payment aggregator must keep the funds it collects for merchants in a separate escrow account with any Scheduled Commercial Bank (SCB) in India. For cross‑border aggregators, the account is referred to as an Inward Collection Account (InCA) for inward transactions or an Outward Collection Account (OCA) for outward transactions, but in all cases it is an escrow account held at a scheduled bank.", "citations": ["D06_B_0018"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000233175, "gen_latency_s": 0.8530258999962825, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2757, "output_tokens": 184, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000233175, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D06_B_0006", "D11_B_0035", "D06_B_0005", "D06_B_0018", "X01_B_0000"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03836040000896901, "total_latency_s": 0.8914878999930806, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.25, "first_hit_rank": 4, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A12", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": true, "answer": "Under the original 2020 guidelines, existing payment aggregators had to reach a net‑worth of ₹15 crore by March 31 2021 and a net‑worth of ₹25 crore by or before March 31 2023.", "citations": ["D05_B_0006"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00021877500000000002, "gen_latency_s": 0.7699343999993289, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2669, "output_tokens": 158, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000218775, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D05_B_0006", "D06_B_0008", "D05_B_0007", "D05_B_0002", "D11_B_0009"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.04450679999717977, "total_latency_s": 0.8145436000049813, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A13", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "For digital payment transactions that are not card‑present, at least one of the authentication factors must be dynamic—i.e., it must be created or proven uniquely for that transaction.", "citations": ["D10_B_0006"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00015652499999999997, "gen_latency_s": 0.8010888999997405, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1791, "output_tokens": 170, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000156525, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D10_B_0006", "D10_B_0013", "D10_B_0001", "D14_B_0012", "D10_B_0005"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.044098500002291985, "total_latency_s": 0.845287099989946, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A14", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "Payment system providers must comply with the RBI's Authentication Mechanisms Directions, 2025 by April 01, 2026.", "citations": ["D10_B_0002"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00012345, "gen_latency_s": 0.8233303999877535, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1642, "output_tokens": 97, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00012345, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D10_B_0002", "D10_B_0003", "D10_B_0000", "D10_B_0001", "D06_B_0000"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.044654700002865866, "total_latency_s": 0.8680831999954535, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A15", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "RBI requires that the authentication factors used in digital payment transactions be independent, meaning that compromise of one factor does not affect the reliability of the other.", "citations": ["D10_B_0007"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00014932499999999998, "gen_latency_s": 1.0170437999913702, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1927, "output_tokens": 112, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000149325, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D10_B_0005", "D10_B_0006", "D10_B_0007", "D10_B_0001", "D13_B_0032"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03510170000663493, "total_latency_s": 1.0522502999956487, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.3333333333333333, "first_hit_rank": 3, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A16", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The maximum value of each prepaid gift instrument shall not exceed Rs.10,000/-.", "citations": ["D11_B_0026"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000168, "gen_latency_s": 0.6634608000022126, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2372, "output_tokens": 95, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1024, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000168, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D11_B_0026", "D11_B_0005", "D11_B_0000", "D11_B_0006", "D16_B_0047"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.036497299995971844, "total_latency_s": 0.7000452000065707, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A17", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The minimum validity period of a prepaid payment instrument (PPI) is one year from the date of last loading or reloading.", "citations": ["D11_B_0041"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000196575, "gen_latency_s": 0.8128031000087503, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2613, "output_tokens": 98, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000196575, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D11_B_0041", "D11_B_0021", "D11_B_0042", "D11_B_0009", "D11_B_0013"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03870949998963624, "total_latency_s": 0.8516019000089727, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A18", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The maximum amount outstanding allowed in a full‑KYC prepaid payment instrument (PPI) is Rs. 2,00,000 at any point in time.", "citations": ["D11_B_0024"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00022365, "gen_latency_s": 0.752853199999663, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2842, "output_tokens": 131, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00022365, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D11_B_0024", "D11_B_0025", "D11_B_0023", "D11_B_0021", "D16_B_0047"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.0405993999884231, "total_latency_s": 0.7935645000106888, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "B-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A19", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "No. Small PPIs (i.e., those issued with only minimum details) may be used only for purchase of goods and services. Cash withdrawal or funds transfer from such PPIs is not permitted.", "citations": ["D11_B_0006", "D11_B_0021"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000235875, "gen_latency_s": 0.8251512999995612, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2537, "output_tokens": 152, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000235875, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D11_B_0022", "D11_B_0023", "D11_B_0025", "D11_B_0021", "D11_B_0006"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.0354246999922907, "total_latency_s": 0.8606681000092067, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.2, "first_hit_rank": 5, "gold_cited": true}
